FlowState Style Lookbook + Interaction Guide (v1)
Product DNA
Clarity, momentum, control, discipline — without fake rewards.
• Core job: keep motivation high without overwhelm; break
years/months/weeks/sessions into quest-like chunks (rewards come from real life).
• Enemies: procrastination and forgetfulness.
• Identity: tool-first (silent + clinical), not a coach.
• Anti-goals: slow UI, noisy gamification, retro/futuristic skins, AI auto-suggestion creep.
Design thesis
FlowState should look like a serious work instrument: dense but readable information, a
single accent color, expandable cards, pinning, and a global Now bar that always tells you
what you are doing.
