Visual system
Aesthetic direction: Notion/Linear with iOS polish
Color strategy
• Neutral-first surfaces: grayscale hierarchy, avoid rainbow dashboards.
• Single accent: accent only for primary actions, selection, and progress.
• State via tone: prefer muted vs strong text before introducing semantic colors.
