Layout + interaction rules
Hybrid density: compact lists + expandable cards + pinning
Locked navigation
Homescreen -> Plan -> Week -> Day -> Session
Bottom tabs (v1):
• Home: Now bar + 1-tap Start Planned Session + pinned essentials.
• Today: fastest logging view; modules + completed strip.
• Plan: your planning surface (week/day selection, session templates).
Completion + Undo law
• Completion collapses: completed items move into a compact Completed strip (count +
expand).
• Undo-first: show Undo toasts broadly; prompts only for destructive deletes/wipes.
Motion + haptics
• Animations: minimal but graceful (150–220 ms); avoid bouncy motion.
• Haptics: subtle; light tick on complete, medium pulse on timer end, gentle warning on
streak risk.
