Session Player requirements (v1)
• Primary mode: checklist with embedded timers.
• Focus mode: optional; isolate active step but keep step list accessible.
• Controls: pause, skip, extend, auto-extend toggle, notes, checkbox to-do list per step.
• Keep-awake: while Session Player is on screen.
• Now bar: global, always shows current session and step position.
