Progress + stats (clinical)
Streaks are awesome. Stats should be detailed, not noisy.
Progress rules
• Quest framing: show session/module completion like quests, but avoid XP/loot/badges.
• Streak chips: compact, always readable; show at-risk state subtly.
• Stats on demand: simple summary first, deeper graphs behind a tap.
Graph priorities
• Completion rate over time (week/month).
• Streak history and streak lengths.
• Key metrics: steps, weight, minutes, sessions, focused time.
• Per-module analytics: frequency, missed days, target attainment.
Do / Don’t
• Do: compact lists by default, expandable cards, pinning, Undo-first, subtle
motion/haptics.
• Don’t: confetti, XP popups, neon skins, AI suggestions, modal spam, slow interactions.
